id: shedding-transformation
name: Shedding Transformation
order: 12
description: >
  Your monstrous power emerges when you would otherwise be defeated.
text: >
  Shedding Transformation: Your monstrous power emerges when you would otherwise be defeated.
  (1)-[Passive]: Double the amount of Life Points you gain from Legend Realized.
  (2)-[Triggered/Defeated]: Set your Life Points to 1 and then, you may either: use the Transformation Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver, or trigger Legend Realized.

---

[passive]
# (1) Legend Realized's Life Points, doubled (chat.mjs legendRealized).
allow shedding.legend;

# (2) Offered on the Defeated card: Life Points 1, then which - the Transformation Maneuver out of sequence (said: Transformations are
# not built), or Legend Realized (chat.mjs shedding).
[triggered/defeated, effect 2]
shedding();
